# The site's HTML is hand-maintained, compact, and inline-everything by design
# (zero-dependency, no build step — see CLAUDE.md "Critical Rules"). Prettier
# would expand it ~2.4x and fight the house style on every edit, so it's excluded
# here. If a build step is ever added, revisit this.
*.html

# Pipeline-generated, provenance-bound Markdown: persona files are emitted by
# reduce_chat_deterministic.py and BYTE-frozen in content/chat/provenance.json
# via LF-normalized text hashes. Reformatting one makes the receipt-bound
# manifest unverifiable by design (pipeline bytes = committed bytes = manifest
# bytes). Hand-authored Markdown and pipeline JSON stay prettier-managed — the
# JSON's canonical hashing is reflow-invariant, persona text hashing is not.
content/chat/personas/
